{"ref": "17a", "original": "ὅτι μὲν ὑμεῖς, ὦ ἄνδρες Ἀθηναῖοι, πεπόνθατε ὑπὸ τῶν ἐμῶν κατηγόρων, οὐκ οἶδα· ἐγὼ δʼ οὖν καὶ αὐτὸς ὑπʼ αὐτῶν ὀλίγου ἐμαυτοῦ ἐπελαθόμην, οὕτω πιθανῶς ἔλεγον. καίτοι ἀληθές γε ὡς ἔπος εἰπεῖν οὐδὲν εἰρήκασιν.", "excerpt": true, "title": "설득력 있는 말과 진실", "korean": "아테네 시민 여러분, 나를 고발한 사람들이 여러분에게 어떤 영향을 주었는지 나는 모릅니다. 나 자신조차 그들의 말을 듣고 하마터면 내가 누구인지 잊을 뻔했습니다. 그만큼 설득력 있게 말했기 때문입니다. 그러나 그들이 한 말 가운데 참된 것은 거의 없습니다.", "sourceUrl": "https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0059.tlg002.perseus-grc2:17/", "groups": [], "notes": ["17a, 29d, 38a에서 각각 일부 문장을 발췌했다. 원문 링크에서 앞뒤 문맥을 확인할 수 있다.", "신약 시대보다 앞선 그리스 철학 전통의 비교 자료다. 여기서 θεός는 소크라테스의 발언 문맥에 따라 신으로 옮겼다."], "source_revision": "sha256:ad5f556327ad53d3153f24240beb36d7a35c26b8741b03d53be65ece49b47b88", "translation_revision": "sha256:852799e29a712a87974c34abea1dc2e54bc4fa4b3970fdc6a6e3569f50e9401e", "work_passage_id": "apology:17a", "html_path": "works/apology/index.html#p-17a", "fixed_html_path": "releases/public-0.5/works/apology/index.html#p-17a", "source_language": "grc", "source_kind": "edited_ancient_original", "alignment_revision": "sha256:6d0368e12cb8207198f52cfa8488eea9717e1087bd5289364c91426efa4ae5d7", "review_state": {"human_reviewed": false, "translation": "ai_authored", "source_check": "pinned_xml_extraction", "targets": {"source_revision": "sha256:ad5f556327ad53d3153f24240beb36d7a35c26b8741b03d53be65ece49b47b88", "translation_revision": "sha256:852799e29a712a87974c34abea1dc2e54bc4fa4b3970fdc6a6e3569f50e9401e", "alignment_revision": "sha256:6d0368e12cb8207198f52cfa8488eea9717e1087bd5289364c91426efa4ae5d7"}}, "rights": {"source": "CC BY-SA 4.0", "source_url": "https://github.com/PerseusDL/canonical-greekLit/blob/bcc5df0602f3b3fe6fefe1e1d575602a25ab1db6/data/tlg0059/tlg002/tlg0059.tlg002.perseus-grc2.xml", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/", "translation": "original_language_translation_public_review_edition"}, "citation": {"author": "플라톤", "work": "소크라테스의 변명", "reference": "17a", "edition": "John Burnet 편, Platonis Opera 1, Oxford: Clarendon Press, 1905. 전자저본의 서지 표기를 따름.", "release": "public-0.5", "translation_revision": "sha256:852799e29a712a87974c34abea1dc2e54bc4fa4b3970fdc6a6e3569f50e9401e", "fixed_path": "releases/public-0.5/works/apology/index.html#p-17a"}}
{"ref": "29d", "original": "ἐγὼ ὑμᾶς, ὦ ἄνδρες Ἀθηναῖοι, ἀσπάζομαι μὲν καὶ φιλῶ, πείσομαι δὲ μᾶλλον τῷ θεῷ ἢ ὑμῖν,", "excerpt": true, "title": "신에게 순종하는 일", "korean": "아테네 시민 여러분, 나는 여러분을 존중하고 사랑합니다. 그러나 여러분보다 신에게 더 순종하겠습니다.", "sourceUrl": "https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0059.tlg002.perseus-grc2:29/", "groups": [], "notes": [], "source_revision": "sha256:508aa9b611aa0669a804aa71b128e7c6b05e912ddd1a7d85c40fc2fbc8fa631a", "translation_revision": "sha256:8a20ea63a5789a22cec5230d271cef410f2dfbd67fab8e33f55e63cfa26b1a24", "work_passage_id": "apology:29d", "html_path": "works/apology/index.html#p-29d", "fixed_html_path": "releases/public-0.5/works/apology/index.html#p-29d", "source_language": "grc", "source_kind": "edited_ancient_original", "alignment_revision": "sha256:f676902e87f7da07aaac88333af8a5fdaf50a8391b82e628bdbc2444ab884e9e", "review_state": {"human_reviewed": false, "translation": "ai_authored", "source_check": "pinned_xml_extraction", "targets": {"source_revision": "sha256:508aa9b611aa0669a804aa71b128e7c6b05e912ddd1a7d85c40fc2fbc8fa631a", "translation_revision": "sha256:8a20ea63a5789a22cec5230d271cef410f2dfbd67fab8e33f55e63cfa26b1a24", "alignment_revision": "sha256:f676902e87f7da07aaac88333af8a5fdaf50a8391b82e628bdbc2444ab884e9e"}}, "rights": {"source": "CC BY-SA 4.0", "source_url": "https://github.com/PerseusDL/canonical-greekLit/blob/bcc5df0602f3b3fe6fefe1e1d575602a25ab1db6/data/tlg0059/tlg002/tlg0059.tlg002.perseus-grc2.xml", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/", "translation": "original_language_translation_public_review_edition"}, "citation": {"author": "플라톤", "work": "소크라테스의 변명", "reference": "29d", "edition": "John Burnet 편, Platonis Opera 1, Oxford: Clarendon Press, 1905. 전자저본의 서지 표기를 따름.", "release": "public-0.5", "translation_revision": "sha256:8a20ea63a5789a22cec5230d271cef410f2dfbd67fab8e33f55e63cfa26b1a24", "fixed_path": "releases/public-0.5/works/apology/index.html#p-29d"}}
{"ref": "38a", "original": "ὁ δὲ ἀνεξέταστος βίος οὐ βιωτὸς ἀνθρώπῳ,", "excerpt": true, "title": "성찰하는 삶", "korean": "성찰하지 않는 삶은 인간에게 살 만한 삶이 아닙니다.", "sourceUrl": "https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0059.tlg002.perseus-grc2:38/", "groups": [], "notes": [], "source_revision": "sha256:1bf8336546e841bef52e0980d457686a40752abbeb7db6d266ff4cb01233a8b7", "translation_revision": "sha256:e139f67373ff7857a96ab4ec414f43eb57be62ee2c0150faf98d0cb52470b766", "work_passage_id": "apology:38a", "html_path": "works/apology/index.html#p-38a", "fixed_html_path": "releases/public-0.5/works/apology/index.html#p-38a", "source_language": "grc", "source_kind": "edited_ancient_original", "alignment_revision": "sha256:181883a3d7b8358a7cdea54097531f28811d063808691107bfe42a11dc25a695", "review_state": {"human_reviewed": false, "translation": "ai_authored", "source_check": "pinned_xml_extraction", "targets": {"source_revision": "sha256:1bf8336546e841bef52e0980d457686a40752abbeb7db6d266ff4cb01233a8b7", "translation_revision": "sha256:e139f67373ff7857a96ab4ec414f43eb57be62ee2c0150faf98d0cb52470b766", "alignment_revision": "sha256:181883a3d7b8358a7cdea54097531f28811d063808691107bfe42a11dc25a695"}}, "rights": {"source": "CC BY-SA 4.0", "source_url": "https://github.com/PerseusDL/canonical-greekLit/blob/bcc5df0602f3b3fe6fefe1e1d575602a25ab1db6/data/tlg0059/tlg002/tlg0059.tlg002.perseus-grc2.xml", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/", "translation": "original_language_translation_public_review_edition"}, "citation": {"author": "플라톤", "work": "소크라테스의 변명", "reference": "38a", "edition": "John Burnet 편, Platonis Opera 1, Oxford: Clarendon Press, 1905. 전자저본의 서지 표기를 따름.", "release": "public-0.5", "translation_revision": "sha256:e139f67373ff7857a96ab4ec414f43eb57be62ee2c0150faf98d0cb52470b766", "fixed_path": "releases/public-0.5/works/apology/index.html#p-38a"}}
